<h2>Install</h2>

<pre><code>pnpm add @quieto/design-tokens @quieto/ui</code></pre>

<p>Load the stylesheet once, at document level, then import the components you need:</p>

<pre><code>import '@quieto/design-tokens/css';
import '@quieto/ui/qds-button.js';</code></pre>

<p>
  The stylesheet is not optional. Custom properties inherit through shadow DOM, so
  it is what themes every component — without it they fall back to hardcoded
  values, render correctly once, and never respond to the theme again.
</p>
